        },
        {
          "text": " “Ŋo da Esera, kwape eiaar acoa naka Ekonideke naejai akanikon, koseu iiaka ka ikatubok, luetubonokinete ituŋa kere luejaas okekwa juwai, lueienete kere ikisila luka Ekonideke, ka ŋol da lomam ejeŋi kisisianakinete ŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
