          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ido ŋol lomam iyuuni aswam ikisila luka Edekekon, ka ikisila luka ekabaka, korubokin ŋes kainyikokin kere, arai naka aario, arai naka aireneario, arai naka ademario luke, arai naka aenio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
